    "body": "## Overview\n\nUse contiguous rank offsets in the fused MoE-LoRA one-shot kernel's A/B pointer arithmetic, retaining the existing rank masks. This implements the first optimization described in #61665.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Removes the rank-offset `tl.where` that obscures contiguity from Triton's axis analysis.\n- Preserves load masks, zero fill, arithmetic, launch parameters, and dispatch.\n- No new speedup or bitwise-equivalence result is claimed for this revision. GPU validation is pending.\n\n## Validation\n\nThis is a draft prepared without new GPU runs. Correctness tests, baseline-versus-patch bitwise comparisons, CUDA-graph replay, kernel profiling, end-to-end benchmarks, and model evaluations have **not** been run for this revision.\n\nCPU-only checks passed:\n- `git diff --check`\n- `uv run --no-project .venv/bin/pre-commit run --files vllm/lora/ops/triton_ops/fused_moe_lora_op.py`\n\nExisting `tests/lora/test_fused_moe_lora_kernel.py` includes ranks 4/8 padded to `BLOCK_R=16`, normal ranks, early exits, and additional one-shot cases. It is selected by the LoRA Buildkite job and its AMD mirror. These correctness tests do not establish the performance improvement or bitwise equivalence to the old kernel.\n\nPending GPU command: `uv run --no-project .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/lora/test_fused_moe_lora_kernel.py -v`. Before marking ready, also compare identical seeded inputs against the base revision, including mixed/base/disabled adapters, padded ranks, and CUDA-graph replay, then measure the one-shot provider on both revisions and end-to-end serving.\n\nThe historical measurements in #61665 motivated this patch; they are not measurements of this PR's current upstream base.\n\n## Details\n\n`safe_offs_r = tl.where(rank_mask, offs_r, 0)` obscures the contiguous rank axis, which is the contiguous dimension of B. Direct `offs_r` avoids that clamp. All A loads (both EVEN_K branches) and the B load retain `rank_mask` and `other=0.0`; [Triton's masked-load contract](https://triton-lang.org/main/python-api/generated/triton.language.load.html) specifies that masked-out addresses are not loaded.\n\nPointer-alignment assertions, N-split annotations, launch tuning, and base-MoE alignment reuse are outside this PR. No public API or configuration changes.\n\nDuplicate check: inspected #61665 and its comments, searched open PRs by issue number and MoE/LoRA rank and one-shot keywords; no existing PR implementing this rank-offset fix was found. AI assistance (OpenAI Codex) was used to extract the existing patch, inspect upstream, and prepare this draft.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise, and updates relevant documentation and examples.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\n</details>\n\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63750?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795611982&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63750&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63750&signature=8e2b372d6e0ba2ce55ca881b689a17bbe14ad5a36f1d6e055b3afb84c4d14d6c\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63750?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795612089&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63750&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63750&signature=4791a40808c914b0ad3fead1fc6528f29f0c0df778c69a3ee8a29705b76a692d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
